                                "sense_id": "370af941-7970-37c9-bbd3-e0a4f4676f0f",
                                "text": "[T]hey have acted in this Calumny both the injuſtice of the Tyrant, and the forgery of the Sophiſt."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
